{"id":"n82176-7-7","stage":3,"title":"파다 · 挖掘","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82176-7-7-1","ko":"너는 땅에서 뭘 그렇게 파고 있어?","zh":"你在地上挖什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"땅에서","meaning":"土，土地，土层","explanation":"땅：土，土地，土层；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"5","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅에서","audio":"/audio/6d80f0ee1c6db897dbfd.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"파고","meaning":"挖掘，发掘","explanation":"파다：挖掘，发掘；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"파다","audio":"/audio/2ba38339ca82f6e44a1a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82176","senseId":"7","lemma":"파다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"파고","audio":"/audio/a843c36d46e21ee83998.mp3"}},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"f330041e9e005a6b","term":"땅","zh":"土，土地，土层","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3","entryId":"30206","definition":"土壤或指土壤的特性。","pronunciation":["땅"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"2ba38339ca82f6e4","term":"파다","zh":"挖掘，发掘","audio":"/audio/2ba38339ca82f6e44a1a.mp3","entryId":"82176","definition":"使原本不露在表面的东西暴露在表面。","pronunciation":["파다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/68852d9ebd61425e6439.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82176-7-7-2","ko":"여기 보물 상자가 묻혀 있는 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得这里好像埋着宝箱。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"보물","meaning":"宝物，宝贝","explanation":"보물：宝物，宝贝。","readings":[{"term":"보물","audio":"/audio/3985b7dc72160b37ee7c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58396","senseId":"1","lemma":"보물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보물","audio":"/audio/3985b7dc72160b37ee7c.mp3"}},{"text":"상자가","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상자가","audio":"/audio/1ebefe6c81187400d1f8.mp3"}},{"text":"묻혀","meaning":"被埋","explanation":"묻히다：被埋；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"묻히다","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15727","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻혀","audio":"/audio/8c3b9edf0b4a014efd99.mp3"}},{"text":"있는","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있는","audio":"/audio/9714c770db7ebcb9f4f1.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같아","audio":"/audio/3eb21a4d72c48bbf26ae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"3985b7dc72160b37","term":"보물","zh":"宝物，宝贝","audio":"/audio/3985b7dc72160b37ee7c.mp3","entryId":"58396","definition":"价值高、非常珍贵的东西。","pronunciation":["보ː물"]},{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"28120c6c18d8503b","term":"묻히다","zh":"被埋","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3","entryId":"15727","definition":"被放在某特定场所内部，并用其它物体掩盖上。","pronunciation":["무치다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3ad5e3cd1ed3034b0e85.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82176","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"7","sourceLevel":"중급","day":114,"sequenceScore":2.9917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我觉得这里好像埋着宝箱。","孩子出生后，家里的气氛似乎变得明亮起来了。","你在地上挖什么呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我觉得这里好像埋着宝箱。","你在地上挖什么呢？","孩子出生后，家里的气氛似乎变得明亮起来了。"],"answer":0}]}
